{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53218","headline":"诗偈 四十三 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 四十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"外若绝攀缘，欢喜常现前。\n本来何所得，吉祥自现形。\n空生成长老，燃灯常照明。\n弥勒是同学，释迦是长兄。\n神通次第坐，无劳问姓名。\n名相有差别，法身同一形。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}